---
layout: base.njk
title: セキュリティ・保守運用ガイド | HP作成マニュアル
description: HPの安全性を確保し、継続的に安定運用するためのセキュリティ対策とメンテナンスの実践ガイドです。
---

<section class="section py-3xl" style="background: var(--color-primary-gradient); color: var(--color-white);">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <span class="text-white font-bold mb-sm d-block" style="opacity: 0.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em;">HP作成マニュアル</span>
        <h1 class="text-white mb-md">セキュリティ・保守運用ガイド</h1>
        <p class="text-white mb-xl" style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); max-width: 800px; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">
            HPの安全性を確保し、継続的に安定運用するための<br>セキュリティ対策とメンテナンスの実践ガイド。
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-beige" style="position: relative; margin-top: -60px; padding-top: var(--space-lg); padding-bottom: var(--space-3xl);">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-md" style="position: relative; z-index: 10;">
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/hp-guide/" class="back-to-top">
                &larr; HP作成マニュアルトップへ
            </a>
            <a href="/{{ locale }}/hp-guide/security-maintenance/list/" class="view-all-link">
                すべての記事一覧を見る &rarr;
            </a>
        </div>

        <div class="grid-3">
            {% set has_posts = false %}
            {% for post in collections.all %}
                {% if ('/hp-guide/security-maintenance/' in post.url)
                    and (post.data.locale == locale)
                    and (post.url != '/' + locale + '/hp-guide/security-maintenance/')
                    and ('list' not in post.url) %}
                    {% set has_posts = true %}
                    <article class="card p-0 blog-item" style="padding: 0; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; border: 1px solid var(--color-border); box-shadow: none; background: white; border-radius: 8px; transition: transform 0.2s;">
                        <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="display: block; aspect-ratio: 16/9; overflow: hidden;">
                            <img src="{{ post.data.thumbnail | default('https://placehold.co/600x400/f1f5f9/94a3b8?text=No+Image') }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; transition: transform 0.3s;">
                        </a>
                        <div class="px-lg py-lg flex-col" style="flex: 1; display: flex;">
                            <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.4; font-weight: bold;">
                                <a href="{{ post.url }}" style="color: inherit; text-decoration: none;">{{ post.data.title }}</a>
                            </h3>
                            <p class="text-secondary mb-lg" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; overflow: hidden; display: -webkit-box; -webkit-box-orient: vertical; -webkit-line-clamp: 2;">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
                            <div class="pt-sm" style="border-top: 1px solid #eee;">
                                <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="text-primary font-bold" style="font-size: 0.9rem; text-decoration: none;">詳しく見る &rarr;</a>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </article>
                {% endif %}
            {% endfor %}
            {% if not has_posts %}
                <div class="text-center w-full py-3xl" style="grid-column: 1/-1;">
                    <p class="text-secondary">現在、公開されている記事はありません。</p>
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{% include "cta1.njk" %}

<style>
    .back-to-top { color: var(--color-text-secondary); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.2s, transform 0.2s; display: flex; align-items: center; }
    .back-to-top:hover { color: var(--color-primary-start); transform: translateX(-3px); text-decoration: underline; }
    .view-all-link { color: var(--color-primary-start); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.95rem; transition: transform 0.2s, opacity 0.2s; display: inline-block; }
    .view-all-link:hover { transform: translateX(5px); opacity: 0.8; text-decoration: underline; }
    .blog-item:hover { transform: translateY(-5px); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08) !important; }
    .blog-item:hover h3 a { color: var(--color-primary-start) !important; }
</style>
